    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw fetch,</i> or <i>carry water,</i>
